# Learning Management System (LMS) Architecture & Cursor Rules

## Stack & Principles
- Next.js 15 App Router, TypeScript (Strict Mode), Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons, Framer Motion, Recharts.
- PostgreSQL Prisma ORM relational schema for Courses, Modules, Lessons, Enrollments, Quizzes, and Certificates.
- Mux Video Player simulation with playback rate, 4K quality, interactive chapters, and lesson completion trackers.
- Interactive Knowledge Check Quiz engine with scoring and cryptographic certificate generation.
- Responsive UX across mobile (<640px), tablet (640px-1024px), and desktop (>1024px).
- Web Analytics integrated via @vercel/analytics and @vercel/speed-insights.
